      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "Huge card for Turnbull Day but conditions will be key with a lot of rain predictedThursday/Friday/Saturday - expecting a heavy track. Small field of brand-new 2yo's kick us off to further complicate things. SILENT INTENT (4) is a Hellbent colt for the McEvoy yard who won a recent jumpout here in fine style. He should take beating. PROVERB (3) was an expensive colt by Written Tycoon for the Freedman yard. He looked stylish coming between runners to win a recent trial and must be respected. MAALEFUSHI (6) was closing off well behind MUSANDAM (7) in a recent jumpout here and there doesn't look much between them. ANKAA (1) is an Anamoe colt for the McEvoy's who has also won a jumpout. Late betting will be key.",
